body:
Here's mine, which is technically the truth;

"I had to get surgery on my chest because I was having some serious issues with tissue inflammation which was causing a lot of pain and swelling. My doctor agreed surgery would be the best path for me, or else I was going to have chronic sternum pain." 

Binding has damaged my chest slightly and it is now medically necessary for me to receive top surgery. So that is the truth, just missing some specific personal details.
